1003:Libs/mbedtls/library/ecp_curves.c **** /*
1004:Libs/mbedtls/library/ecp_curves.c ****  * If the result is negative, we get it in the form
1005:Libs/mbedtls/library/ecp_curves.c ****  * c * 2^bits + N, with c negative and N positive shorter than 'bits'
